            0.659,
            0.846,
            0.698
          ],
          "content": "Similarly, if a value smaller than the mean is included, then the new mean will be less than before."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.112,
            0.708,
            0.801,
            0.748
          ],
          "content": "？ What happens to the mean when an existing value is removed? When will the mean increase, decrease, or stay the same?"
